<title>UK: Merrill sets 150 mln mark 4-year Euro-Certificates.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets 150 mln mark 4-year Euro-Certificates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of German top twelve Euro-Certificates was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch (Deutscheland).</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH INTERNATIONAL &amp; CO CV CURACAO</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO (RATED AA3/A+)</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     =	   MATURITY	 NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.30	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX,FFT   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC  2.0</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION WILL BE LINKED TO GERMAN TOP TWELVE TOTAL</p>
<p>		RETURN INDEX AT MATURITY.</p>
<p>		THERE ARE PUT OPTIONS ON 06.NOV.98 AND 05.NOV.99.</p>
<p>		 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
